---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About - Your Name"
  description="About me and what I do"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <article class="prose">
      <h1 class="mb-8">About Me</h1>

      <p class="text-xl text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-8">
        I'm a developer and designer who loves building things on the internet.
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-text">
        <p>
          I believe in building in public, sharing what I learn, and celebrating
          progress over perfection. Not everything I make is polished—some projects
          are half-finished experiments, others are fully shipped products. All of
          them taught me something.
        </p>

        <p>
          My interests span across web development, design systems, typography,
          and creating tools that make creative work easier. I'm particularly
          drawn to minimal, thoughtful interfaces that prioritize calm over chaos.
        </p>

        <p>
          This site is a timeline of my journey. You'll find blog posts about
          lessons learned, projects I've built (finished and unfinished), and
          small experiments that sparked curiosity.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-12 mb-4">What I Work With</h2>

        <p>
          Most of my work involves JavaScript/TypeScript, React, Next.js, and
          Tailwind CSS. I also enjoy working with Astro, Node.js, and exploring
          new tools that improve the developer experience.
        </p>

        <p>
          I care deeply about performance, accessibility, and creating interfaces
          that feel good to use.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-12 mb-4">Get In Touch</h2>

        <p>
          I'm always interested in connecting with people building cool things.
        </p>

        <div class="flex gap-4 mt-6">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/yourusername"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-text hover:text-accent transition-colors"
          >
            GitHub
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://twitter.com/yourusername"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-text hover:text-accent transition-colors"
          >
            Twitter
          </a>
          <a
            href="mailto:your@email.com"
            class="text-text hover:text-accent transition-colors"
          >
            Email
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose p {
    @apply mb-6;
  }

  .prose h2 {
    @apply text-h2;
  }

  .prose a {
    @apply underline decoration-border hover:decoration-accent;
  }
</style>
